    "title": "Fonts Keyboard",
    "description": "Express yourself the way you want, with the most downloaded Fonts keyboard in the world! Feeling gothic? Or maybe looking for something more romantic? What are you today: bold or playful? Or do you just wanna to keep it fancy? Fonts has got you covered!\r\nMake your social media profiles stand out with Fonts, or send cool texts to your friends. Turn heads, stand out, get creative! You can use Fonts keyboard for your:\r\n\u2022 Text messages\r\n\u2022 Social media bios\r\n\u2022 Post descriptions\r\n\u2022 Stories\r\n\u2026 the only limit is your imagination!\r\n\r\nFonts works on Instagram, Snapchat, Facebook, Messenger, Telegram, TikTok, Roblox, WhatsApp, Twitch, Discord, and many more!\r\n\r\nTHE BEST FONTS AND SYMBOLS\r\nChoose among dozens of:\r\n\u2022 Fonts\r\n\u2022 Sticker Fonts\r\n\u2022 Symbols\r\n\u2022 Kaomojis \r\n...and more! Express yourself like never before!\r\n\r\nStill not sure this is the app you\u2019re looking for? What if we told you that Fonts is completely FREE? \r\n\r\nDon\u2019t forget to check out our updates. New content is added regularly! \r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re enjoying Fonts, then please leave a review! You\u2019ll make us happy and help others discover your favorite app for custom fonts and symbols.\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Join millions of Fonts enthusiasts!\r\n\r\nTerms of service:\r\nhttps://bendingspoons.com/tos.html?app=1454061614\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: \r\nhttps://bendingspoons.com/privacy.html?app=1454061614\r\n\r\nWebsite:\r\nhttps://www.fontskeyboard.com/ \r\n\r\nHave a feature request you would like to see in a future version of the app? Do not hesitate to contact us at fonts-android@bendingspoons.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Express yourself the way you want, with the most downloaded Fonts keyboard in the world! Feeling gothic? Or maybe looking for something more romantic? What are you today: bold or playful? Or do you just wanna to keep it fancy? Fonts has got you covered!<br>Make your social media profiles stand out with Fonts, or send cool texts to your friends. Turn heads, stand out, get creative! You can use Fonts keyboard for your:<br>\u2022 Text messages<br>\u2022 Social media bios<br>\u2022 Post descriptions<br>\u2022 Stories<br>\u2026 the only limit is your imagination!<br><br>Fonts works on Instagram, Snapchat, Facebook, Messenger, Telegram, TikTok, Roblox, WhatsApp, Twitch, Discord, and many more!<br><br>THE BEST FONTS AND SYMBOLS<br>Choose among dozens of:<br>\u2022 Fonts<br>\u2022 Sticker Fonts<br>\u2022 Symbols<br>\u2022 Kaomojis <br>...and more! Express yourself like never before!<br><br>Still not sure this is the app you\u2019re looking for? What if we told you that Fonts is completely FREE? <br><br>Don\u2019t forget to check out our updates. New content is added regularly! <br><br>If you\u2019re enjoying Fonts, then please leave a review! You\u2019ll make us happy and help others discover your favorite app for custom fonts and symbols.<br><br>What are you waiting for? Join millions of Fonts enthusiasts!<br><br>Terms of service:<br>https://bendingspoons.com/tos.html?app=1454061614<br><br>Privacy policy: <br>https://bendingspoons.com/privacy.html?app=1454061614<br><br>Website:<br>https://www.fontskeyboard.com/ <br><br>Have a feature request you would like to see in a future version of the app? Do not hesitate to contact us at fonts-android@bendingspoons.com",
